---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '@components/shared/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '@components/shared/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Spatia"
  description="How Spatia collects, uses and protects the information you submit through the contact and whitepaper forms on spatia.sg."
>
  <Navbar />
  <main>
    <section class="py-[120px]">
      <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-8 md:px-16">

        <!-- Label -->
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-[#0F4A46] mb-6 reveal">
          Legal
        </p>

        <!-- Headline -->
        <h1 class="text-[48px] md:text-[64px] font-bold tracking-tight text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.05] mb-8 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          We Respect Your Privacy
        </h1>

        <p class="max-w-[800px] text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7] mb-4 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          This notice explains what Spatia collects through spatia.sg, why we collect it, who processes it, and what you can ask us to do with it. It covers the two forms on this site: the contact enquiry form and the whitepaper download form.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm text-[#5B6570] mb-16 reveal reveal-delay-1">
          Effective 26 November 2026. Version 1.0.
        </p>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div class="max-w-[800px] space-y-12 reveal reveal-delay-2">

          <!-- In short -->
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-[#0E1114] mb-6">In short</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7] list-none">
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span>We collect what you type into a form, and nothing more.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span>We use it to answer you, send the whitepaper and follow up only if you agreed.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span>We never sell or rent it. Zoho stores the records and sends our email on our behalf.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Divider -->
          <div class="border-t border-[#E6E6EA]"></div>

          <!-- What we collect -->
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-[#0E1114] mb-5">What we collect</h2>
            <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7]">
              <p>
                <strong>Contact enquiry form.</strong> Your name, work email, company, phone number if you choose to give it, and the message you write.
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong>Whitepaper download form.</strong> Your name, work email, company, phone number if you choose to give it, and what you want to solve if you write it. This is what we need to send you the file and to know which topics are useful to the people who read them.
              </p>
              <p>
                Both forms record the time of submission. Our web host also keeps standard request logs, such as IP address, browser type and pages requested, for security and troubleshooting.
              </p>
              <p>
                We do not ask for payment details, government identifiers or special category data. Please do not include that kind of information in a message.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Divider -->
          <div class="border-t border-[#E6E6EA]"></div>

          <!-- How we use it -->
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-[#0E1114] mb-5">How we use it</h2>
            <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7]">
              <ul class="space-y-3 list-none">
                <li class="flex gap-3">
                  <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  <span>To answer your enquiry and continue the conversation you started.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-3">
                  <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  <span>To send the whitepaper you asked for, and to follow up on that topic only if you agreed to hear from us.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-3">
                  <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  <span>To keep a record of the consent you gave, so we can show it if asked.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-3">
                  <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  <span>To keep the site secure and see, in aggregate, which pages and downloads are useful.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
              <p>
                We do not sell or rent your information. We do not use it for automated decision making or profiling.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Divider -->
          <div class="border-t border-[#E6E6EA]"></div>

          <!-- Consent -->
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-[#0E1114] mb-5">Consent and your choice</h2>
            <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7]">
              <p>
                We process what you submit on the basis of the consent you give when you tick the consent box and submit a form. For business enquiries we also rely on our legitimate interest in responding to you. Under India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, you give consent for the purposes described in this notice only.
              </p>
              <p>
                You can withdraw consent at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:people@spatia.sg" class="text-[#0F4A46] underline underline-offset-4 hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity">people@spatia.sg</a>. Withdrawal does not affect processing that already happened. Every marketing email we send includes an unsubscribe link.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Divider -->
          <div class="border-t border-[#E6E6EA]"></div>

          <!-- Who processes it -->
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-[#0E1114] mb-5">Who processes it</h2>
            <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7]">
              <p>
                <strong>Zoho.</strong> Zoho CRM records the details you submit so our team can follow up, and Zoho Mail sends the confirmation and notification emails. Zoho processes this data on our instructions and under its own privacy commitment.
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong>Google reCAPTCHA.</strong> The forms use Google reCAPTCHA to filter automated submissions. It may set cookies and receives your IP address and signals about your browser. It is used only for that check.
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong>Our service providers.</strong> Our email and website hosting providers process data to deliver mail and run the site. They receive only what those services need.
              </p>
              <p>
                <strong>Legal disclosure.</strong> We may disclose information if a law, court or regulator requires it, or to protect our rights.
              </p>
              <p>
                Zoho operates data centres in several regions and may process your information outside the country where you live. Where that happens, the transfer is covered by Zoho's contractual commitments and the notice you see here.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Divider -->
          <div class="border-t border-[#E6E6EA]"></div>

          <!-- Cookies -->
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-[#0E1114] mb-5">Cookies and analytics</h2>
            <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7]">
              <p>
                spatia.sg does not run analytics or advertising cookies. The forms use Google reCAPTCHA, which may set cookies needed to tell a person from a bot. The campaign parameters in a link (utm_source, utm_medium, utm_campaign) are sent with the form so we know which page brought you, and are not used to track you across other sites.
              </p>
              <p>
                If we add analytics later, we will update this notice before the change goes live.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Divider -->
          <div class="border-t border-[#E6E6EA]"></div>

          <!-- Retention -->
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-[#0E1114] mb-5">How long we keep it</h2>
            <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7]">
              <ul class="space-y-3 list-none">
                <li class="flex gap-3">
                  <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  <span>Contact enquiries: 24 months after our last exchange.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-3">
                  <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  <span>Whitepaper downloads: 24 months after the download.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex gap-3">
                  <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                  <span>Consent records: as long as needed to show we had your permission.</span>
                </li>
              </ul>
              <p>
                When a period ends, we delete the record or remove what identifies you. If you ask us to delete your data sooner, we will, unless we are required to keep it.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Divider -->
          <div class="border-t border-[#E6E6EA]"></div>

          <!-- Your rights -->
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-[#0E1114] mb-5">Your access to and control over information</h2>
            <p class="text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7] mb-5">
              You can ask us to do any of the following at any time:
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7] list-none">
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span>See what data we have about you, if any.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span>Correct anything that is wrong or out of date.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span>Delete your data, subject to records we must keep by law.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span>Withdraw consent or opt out of future contact.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-3">
                <span class="mt-[10px] w-[6px] h-[6px] rounded-full bg-[#0F4A46] flex-shrink-0"></span>
                <span>Raise a concern about how we handled your data.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7] mt-5">
              Email <a href="mailto:people@spatia.sg" class="text-[#0F4A46] underline underline-offset-4 hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity">people@spatia.sg</a> with the subject line "Privacy request". We aim to respond within 30 days.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Divider -->
          <div class="border-t border-[#E6E6EA]"></div>

          <!-- Security -->
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-[#0E1114] mb-5">Security</h2>
            <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7]">
              <p>
                We take precautions to protect your information. Form responses are held in Zoho's systems and access is limited to employees who need them for a specific job, such as sales, engineering or marketing. Our own devices and accounts are protected and kept in a controlled environment.
              </p>
              <p>
                No system is perfectly secure. If a breach affects your data, we will notify you and the relevant authority as the law requires.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Divider -->
          <div class="border-t border-[#E6E6EA]"></div>

          <!-- Children -->
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-[#0E1114] mb-5">Children</h2>
            <p class="text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7]">
              This site is for business use and is not directed at anyone under 18. We do not knowingly collect data from children. If you believe a child has submitted a form, email us and we will delete the record.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Divider -->
          <div class="border-t border-[#E6E6EA]"></div>

          <!-- Changes -->
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-[#0E1114] mb-5">Changes to this notice</h2>
            <p class="text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7]">
              We may update this notice as the site or the law changes. The effective date at the top moves when we do, and material changes will be described on this page. If a change affects an enquiry already in progress, we will tell you by email.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Divider -->
          <div class="border-t border-[#E6E6EA]"></div>

          <!-- Contact -->
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-[22px] font-semibold text-[#0E1114] mb-5">Contact and grievance</h2>
            <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] text-[#0E1114] leading-[1.7]">
              <p>
                Questions about this notice, or about the data we hold on you, go to <a href="mailto:people@spatia.sg" class="text-[#0F4A46] underline underline-offset-4 hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity">people@spatia.sg</a>.
              </p>
              <p>
                Grievance Officer, Spatia: <a href="mailto:people@spatia.sg" class="text-[#0F4A46] underline underline-offset-4 hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity">people@spatia.sg</a>. We aim to acknowledge a grievance within 7 days and resolve it within 30 days.
              </p>
              <p>
                If you are not satisfied with our response, you can raise the matter with the Data Protection Board of India, or with the data protection authority in the country where you live.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
